evidence = "The workspace-command changes in commit af06786c430b7de5c843814907b4f9246fa9cf51 remain at .github/workflows/launchpad-test.yml:75 and .github/workflows/launchpad-test.yml:76 and at .github/workflows/wallet-test.yml:25 and .github/workflows/wallet-test.yml:72, but tests/ci/test_launchpad_test_workflow.py:78 and tests/ci/test_launchpad_test_workflow.py:79 still require the old launchpad command and directory and tests/ci/test_wallet_repair_suites_listed.py:78 still requires a literal wallet command, although commit 661007bc729b355a7d2eb1d843c691aa23715e3c already corrected the wallet matrix assertions at tests/ci/test_wallet_test_workflow.py:37, tests/ci/test_wallet_test_workflow.py:100 and tests/ci/test_wallet_test_workflow.py:126."
close_comment = "The wallet matrix checks already match the per-package commands, but the launchpad command check and wallet repair-suite scope check still expect the previous step shapes. Those two checks need to validate the launchpad workspace filter and the resolved wallet matrix command while retaining package and repair-suite coverage."

